MockMic — Day 6/10
Practice out loud. Walk in ready.
A voice-first mock interview practice app. Users pick an interview category, answer AI-generated questions, and get instant structured feedback — built as a 10-day capstone for the AB Talks #60DaysOfClaudeAI challenge.
